    "description": "Casa Bella Residences by B\u0026amp;B Italia  is a standout luxury tower which introduces a new level of European design excellence to Miami’s prestigious Arts \u0026amp; Cultural District,  through its exclusive partnership with the iconic B\u0026amp;B Italia brand actually delivering these luxury residences with panoramic Biscayne Bay and skyline views.\n\nDeveloped by Related Group and Alta Developers, with architecture by Arquitectonica and interiors by Piero Lissoni, it fuses bold contemporary design, refined finishes, and world-class amenities.\n\nPresented internationally by Prime Address Monaco, it offers global buyers a delivery ready, rare design-driven residence in one of Miami’s most dynamic luxury markets.\n\nCasa Bella Residences sits in the heart of Miami’s vibrant Arts \u0026amp; Cultural District, steps from the Pérez Art Museum Miami, Frost Museum of Science, and Adrienne Arsht Center.\n\nPerfectly connected Brickell, Miami Beach, Design District, and Wynwood, it’s minutes from top restaurants, boutiques, and business hubs. Miami International Airport is also easily accessible—ideal for global residents.\n\nArquitectonica’s striking architecture uses bold geometry and floor-to-ceiling glass for spectacular Biscayne Bay and skyline views.\n\nInteriors by Piero Lissoni and Partners showcase premium materials, custom Italian cabinetry, and refined finishes for effortless contemporary living.\n\n' Incredibly luxurious and monumental, a showcase for an exceptional lifestyle!'\n\nThe exclusive Penthouse collection includes six spacious penthouses with 11-foot ceilings and four upper penthouses with 12-foot ceilings.\nTwo of the upper penthouses feature a private rooftop terrace, a swimming pool, a summer kitchen, and incredible views of the sea and the city center.\n\nCasaBella Residences by B\u0026amp;B Italia offers the exclusive opportunity\nto have your home designed by B\u0026amp;B Italia, Italy's leading luxury furniture brand.\nB\u0026amp;B Italia's renowned designers have worked to create luxurious interiors that reflect your individual aesthetic, with carefully selected pieces from B\u0026amp;B Italia's collections not only for the building's common areas, but also with custom furniture packages for each residential unit.\n\nState-of-the-art kitchens. Elegant Italian cabinetry in kitchens and bathrooms by ITALKRAFT. An exquisite selection of cabinet and countertop finishes, all individually selected by Piero Lissoni. A premium black glass appliance package that includes a 36-inch Sub-Zero built-in coated refrigerator/freezer, a silent coated dishwasher, a Wolf built-in convection oven, a Wolf built-in rapid oven, a ceramic cooktop, and a wine cooler (in most units). A large, zero-radius stainless steel sink with a drawer and a European-designed single-lever faucet.\n\nMaster bathrooms with Italian-designed cabinetry, Backlit makeup mirror, Elongated electric toilet, Spacious frameless glass-enclosed bathtubs and showers, in master bathrooms, Imported porcelain tile flooring and walls\nItalian-designed faucets, Vanity \n\nAll residences feature two private elevators and a private lobby. The elevators are equipped with biometric access control for added security. \n\nEnjoy stunning views everywhere you turn. Surround yourself with soaring, light-flooded interiors, garden-filled grounds, and unrivaled, abundant amenities, including a poolside lounge with a Mediterranean café and craft cocktails.\nA serene aesthetic, an exquisite blend of exterior and interior, carefully crafted\nwith exclusive materials and a proprietary technique.\n\nCasaBella Residences by B\u0026amp;B Italia offers two full floors filled with amenities, including a state-of-the-art fitness and wellness center, dedicated leisure spaces, and a robust business center. \nGame room\nChildren's playroom with educational games and a smart board\nSpacious party room overlooking Biscayne Bay\nCinema\nWine cellar\nMuseum-quality art collection\nFully equipped business center and conference room\nCo-working space with a comfortable lounge\nPet spa\n360 Wellness Center including: State-of-the-art fitness center overlooking Biscayne Bay, private yoga studio, spin studio, world-class spa offering a full range of à la carte services, and beauty salon with manicure and pedicure stations.\n\nA stunning 11th-floor pool deck with Italian-inspired gardens designed by world-renowned landscape architect Enzo Enea, a luxurious spa, and a 20-meter pool with incredible views of Biscayne Bay.\nPoolside bar and Mediterranean café, private cabanas and shaded seating areas. Towel service and sunscreen kiosk. Outdoor yoga lawn. Pickleball court. Private dining room with a designated outdoor grilling area. World-class artwork in the common areas.\n\nThe rooftop pool and terrace, which rise to over 150 meters high, include CasaBella's private observatory (with a state-of-the-art telescope) and offer extraordinary panoramic views of Biscayne Bay.\n\nAll residents enjoy one year of privileged access to the Grand Bay Beach Club in Key Biscayne.\n\n24/7 Services:\nValet parking service\nMultilingual team on-site to assist you at any time\nSecurity\nMaintenance staff\n\nPersonalized concierge service tailored to your needs; Cleaning, Pre-arrival grocery shopping and delivery, Butler and housekeeping services, Dry cleaning and laundry, Babysitting and childcare, Overnight shoe shining, Pet care services, \nPreferred theater and event tickets, Courier services, Personal IT and technology support, Translation services, Newspaper delivery\n\n\nCasa Bella Residences represents a compelling opportunity for international investors seeking prime real estate in Miami’s luxury residential market, a long-term value as a high-quality investment.",
